    4325   00:55BC  DB 06             >     in a,(IN_DATA_PORT)
    4326   00:55BE  05                      dec b
    4327   00:55BF  20 F0                   jr  nz,SSH_OPEN_ST2
    4328   00:55C1                      
    4329   00:55C1                          ; now just get the 1 byte, conn#, should go to B
