    5133   00:5998                      ;=======================
    5134   00:5998                      ;===  TCPIP_TCP_RCV  ===
    5135   00:5998                      ;=======================
    5136   00:5998                      ;Receive data from a TCP connection.
    5137   00:5998                      ;
